<title>SWITZERLAND: SPEED SKATING-WORLD CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SPEED SKATING-WORLD CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>DAVOS, Switzerland 1997-01-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading placings from a</p>
<p>World Cup speed skating competition on Saturday:</p>
